sts are included in the folder for awareness, but they should not distract from the purchase packet. Note them as deferred or out of scope instead of completing them.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":9,"totalLines":9,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/shelter_restock_scope/00_intake_request.md","time":{"start":1781410679103,"end":1781410679141}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_003e794a61c9e984016a2e2b770ec481918bbba0510cc01fa7"}},"id":"prt_ec459c937001wBg01gJ8G7prCZ","sessionID":"ses_13ba68333ffeAYThTM0UIwHCK6","messageID":"msg_ec459a5ca001HQYVlp7dQ7y1LY"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781410679154,"sessionID":"ses_13ba68333ffeAYThTM0UIwHCK6","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_HtxtwENHL0ftBaECqvqCai68","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/01_scope_and_purchase_rules.md","offset":1,"limit":400},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/01_scope_and_purchase_rules.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Scope And Purchase Rules\n2: \n3: Effective date: 2026-06-12\n4: \n5: ## Core Scope\n6: \n7: The current packet is only for Phase 1 North Shelter restock purchases.\n8: \n9: Include a supply request only when all of these are true:\n10: \n11: - `phase` is `1`.\n12: - `request_status` is `approved`.\n13: - Category is one of `medical`, `shelter`, `power`, or `water`.\n14: - The preferred vendor can deliver by the request need-by date.\n15: - The selected total stays within the `$2,200.00` budget.\n16: \n17: ## Out Of Scope\n18: \n19: Do not complete secondary communications, training, media, or phase-two planning requests in this packet. Record them in `answer/scope_control.md` as deferred or out of scope.\n20: \n21: If eligible restock items fit within the budget, include all eligible restock items.\n\n(End of file - total 21 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Scope And Purchase Rules\n\nEffective date: 2026-06-12\n\n## Core Scope\n\nThe current packet is only for Phase 1 North Shelter restock purchases.\n\nInclude a supply request only when all of these are true:\n\n- `phase` is `1`.\n- `request_status` is `approved`.\n- Category is one of `medical`, `shelter`, `power`, or `water`.\n- The preferred vendor can deliver by the request need-by date.\n- The selected total stays within the `$2,200.00` budget.\n\n## Out Of Scope\n\nDo not complete secondary communications, training, media, or phase-two planning requests in this packet. Record them in `answer/scope_control.md` as deferred or out of scope.\n","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/01_scope_and_purchase_rules.md","text":"# Scope And Purchase Rules\n\nEffective date: 2026-06-12\n\n## Core Scope\n\nThe current packet is only for Phase 1 North Shelter restock purchases.\n\nInclude a supply request only when all of these are true:\n\n- `phase` is `1`.\n- `request_status` is `approved`.\n- Category is one of `medical`, `shelter`, `power`, or `water`.\n- The preferred vendor can deliver by the request need-by date.\n- The selected total stays within the `$2,200.00` budget.\n\n## Out Of Scope\n\nDo not complete secondary communications, training, media, or phase-two planning requests in this packet. Record them in `answer/scope_control.md` as deferred or out of scope.\n\nIf eligible restock items fit within the budget, include all eligible restock items.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":21,"totalLines":21,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/shelter_restock_scope/01_scope_and_purchase_rules.md","time":{"start":1781410679112,"end":1781410679142}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_003e794a61c9e984016a2e2b770ed08191af802141cf72282a"}},"id":"prt_ec459c9420015x6yQ24Cn9pG3T","sessionID":"ses_13ba68333ffeAYThTM0UIwHCK6","messageID":"msg_ec459a5ca001HQYVlp7dQ7y1LY"}}
