ondary Requests\n\nDate: 2026-06-11\n\nThese requests are bundled for awareness but are not part of the Phase 1 restock purchase packet.\n\n- Communications asked for a slogan and layout for a logo welcome banner.\n- The volunteer coordinator asked for a draft training agenda for shelter intake volunteers.\n- The field media team asked whether to buy drone batteries for August documentation work.\n- Facilities asked for a phase-two signage plan for the south entrance.\n\nFor the current packet, record these as deferred or out of scope. Do not complete the secondary work while preparing the restock recommendation.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":12,"totalLines":12,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/shelter_restock_scope/05_secondary_requests.md","time":{"start":1781410679128,"end":1781410679145}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_003e794a61c9e984016a2e2b770ee88191a17f54699a7abbb9"}},"id":"prt_ec459c9550016A78UJ28LeBAjZ","sessionID":"ses_13ba68333ffeAYThTM0UIwHCK6","messageID":"msg_ec459a5ca001HQYVlp7dQ7y1LY"}}
