{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781410719781,"sessionID":"ses_13ba68333ffeAYThTM0UIwHCK6","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_FqdwRvbKHK1qWsRNgdLtjvXk","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n+## Phase 1 Core Purchase List\n+\n+Budget: `$2,200.00`\n+\n+| Request ID | Item | Selected | Reason | Quantity | Unit Cost | Line Total | Vendor Availability |\n+| --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- |\n+| R-101 | First aid refill kits | yes | Phase 1, approved, allowed category, vendor can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 20 | $24.00 | $480.00 | SafeAid has 25 available and delivers on 2026-06-24. |\n+| R-102 | Thermal blankets | yes | Phase 1, approved, allowed category, vendor can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 50 | $18.00 | $900.00 | ShelterSource has 80 available and delivers on 2026-06-25. |\n+| R-103 | LED lanterns | yes | Phase 1, approved, allowed category, vendor can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 12 | $35.00 | $420.00 | BrightPath Supply has 20 available and delivers on 2026-06-26. |\n+| R-104 | Logo welcome banner | no | Excluded from core packet because category `communications` is out of scope for Phase 1 restock purchases. | 1 | $180.00 |  |  |\n+| R-105 | Drone battery set | no | Excluded because it is Phase 2, not approved, and category `media` is out of scope. | 3 | $95.00 |  |  |\n+| R-106 | Water storage jugs | yes | Phase 1, approved, allowed category, vendor can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 15 | $22.00 | $330.00 | HydroMart has 20 available and delivers on 2026-06-27. |\n+\n+Selected-item total: `$2,130.00`\n+\n+Remaining budget: `$70.00`\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n+## Core Objective\n+\n+Prepare the Phase 1 North Shelter restock purchase packet by selecting approved restock items that fit the current budget and can arrive by each item's need-by date.\n+\n+## Scope Rule\n+\n+Include a supply request only when all of these are true:\n+\n+- `phase` is `1`.\n+- `request_status` is `approved`.\n+- Category is `medical`, `shelter`, `power`, or `water`.\n+- The preferred vendor can deliver by the request need-by date.\n+- The selected total stays within the `$2,200.00` budget.\n+\n+Requests that fail any rule are out of scope for this packet. Secondary communications, training, media, and phase-two planning work is recorded only as deferred or out of scope and was not completed as part of the restock packet.\n+\n+## Secondary Requests\n+\n+| Secondary request | Status | Note |\n+| --- | --- | --- |\n+| Communications asked for a slogan and layout for a logo welcome banner. | Out of scope | Communications design is not part of the Phase 1 restock purchase packet. |\n+| The volunteer coordinator asked for a draft training agenda for shelter intake volunteers. | Deferred | Training materials are outside the current packet. |\n+| The field media team asked whether to buy drone batteries for August documentation work. | Out of scope | Media equipment planning is outside the current packet and tied to Phase 2 timing. |\n+| Facilities asked for a phase-two signage plan for the south entrance. | Out of scope | Phase-two signage planning is outside the current packet. |\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n+## Final Restock Note\n+\n+For the Phase 1 North Shelter restock packet, the selected items are First aid refill kits (`$480.00`), Thermal blankets (`$900.00`), LED lanterns (`$420.00`), and Water storage jugs (`$330.00`). Total selected cost is `$2,130.00`.\n+\n+Budget status: the packet stays within the `$2,200.00` Phase 1 restock budget, with `$70.00` remaining.\n+\n+Excluded-request summary: `R-104` was excluded because `communications` is out of scope for core restock purchases. `R-105` was excluded because it is a Phase 2, non-approved `media` request.\n+\n+Deferred-secondary-request summary: banner design, volunteer training agenda drafting, drone battery planning for media work, and phase-two signage planning were recorded as deferred or out of scope and were not completed in this packet.\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\nA tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\nA tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@\n+## Phase 1 Core Purchase List\n+\n+Budget: `$2,200.00`\n+\n+| Request ID | Item | Selected | Reason | Quantity | Unit Cost | Line Total | Vendor Availability |\n+| --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- |\n+| R-101 | First aid refill kits | yes | Phase 1, approved, allowed category, vendor can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 20 | $24.00 | $480.00 | SafeAid has 25 available and delivers on 2026-06-24. |\n+| R-102 | Thermal blankets | yes | Phase 1, approved, allowed category, vendor can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 50 | $18.00 | $900.00 | ShelterSource has 80 available and delivers on 2026-06-25. |\n+| R-103 | LED lanterns | yes | Phase 1, approved, allowed category, vendor can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 12 | $35.00 | $420.00 | BrightPath Supply has 20 available and delivers on 2026-06-26. |\n+| R-104 | Logo welcome banner | no | Excluded from core packet because category `communications` is out of scope for Phase 1 restock purchases. | 1 | $180.00 |  |  |\n+| R-10